          "name": "Filter F",
          "type": "TUniqueFunction<bool ( int )>&",
          "default": "nullptr"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Add all one-ring neighbours of current selection to set.\nOn a large selection this is quite expensive as we don't know the boundary,\nso we have to iterate over all selected vertices.\nReturn false from FilterF to prevent vertices from being included."
